<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-3916] notebook icon can not hide correctly when move inside the tooltip</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3916</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/12952281/12952281_Kapture+2018-12-19+at+11.28.42.gif&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;According to the&#160;code&#160;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/blob/a6f45629459018fefa55eb57da8ce3fb87eb4a5f/zeppelin-web/src/app/home/notebook-template.html#L17&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/blob/a6f45629459018fefa55eb57da8ce3fb87eb4a5f/zeppelin-web/src/app/home/notebook-template.html#L17&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&apos;showNoteButton&apos; should be clear when&#160;mouseleave, but the icon still&#160;display&#160;when the mouse moves&#160;from the bottom of the tooltip.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This can be fixed by changing the ng-mouseover and ng-mouseleave&#160;to&#160;css&#160;selector.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
